{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1434.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"2a24be775749569d6fb988b1d3d3c4bfa33b45aadb54201448e86f9cbf5f561f","ja":"これもトレーニング！","zh":"这也是训练！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1434.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"3cb281affd0715cb06576962195ccf8b41e0bdc9f997ab8a8d3260a7cea099c7","ja":"あはっ、あはははははっ！　\nこ、これ以上笑わせないで、あはははっ！","zh":"啊哈哈，啊哈哈哈哈哈！　\n别、别再逗我笑了，啊哈哈哈！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1434.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"616e852266468705db90f51f9cb955664f785a0b9e4ba8db82a315ba02211540","ja":"この声は……我那覇さんかしら？\nずいぶん楽しそうね。","zh":"这个声音……是我那霸同学吗？\n听起来相当开心呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1434.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"a769c616ebfd0b2885fb9922f39347122be030a041c70422c9e3d48d19cad66a","ja":"どうしたの、我那覇さん？\n笑い声が外まで聞こえてたわよ。","zh":"怎么了吗，我那霸同学？\n笑声都传到外面来了哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1434.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"e06e740ee08c3a3c63ae516a949332009eb08a4e13fb009245020a6c9959a736","ja":"あっ、千早、助けて！\n真がずっと面白い顔をして……。","zh":"啊，千早，快救我！\n真一直在做搞笑的表情……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1434.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"b5cff51c9d2d5b987b316cb6dc441c6f81e77858c9335754cb585192f16f03d4","ja":"あははっ！　ま、真、やめて～！","zh":"啊哈哈！真、真，快住手～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1434.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"5397bbf3fd4662f0c1708e173fba33cd3e9f0451879674273872afd34b8fbfe2","ja":"にらめっこでもしてるの？\n真、我那覇さんも困ってるし、そのくらいで……。","zh":"你们是在大眼瞪小眼吗？\n真，我那霸同学也挺为难的，就先到此为止吧……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1434.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"e6db7896b1cd5f322176196e0203fea9e0042f4e55e601be61b691a121020626","ja":"誤解だって！　ボクは表情筋の\nストレッチをしてるだけなんだってば～！","zh":"这是误会啦！我只是在做\n面部肌肉的拉伸而已啦～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1434.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"ce765707999ac08bb0d51afc3313308bf1044b2e8bc2424a90d9047e90c51fef","ja":"千早からも、これがちゃんとした\nトレーニングだって、言ってやってよ～。","zh":"千早也跟她说说嘛，\n这可是正经的训练哦～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1434.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"c4b1a3b805d4fb8c5cefb30598273c3cea16134c96d03325bdac72310afb7ad7","ja":"あっ……！　我那覇さん、真がしているのは\n表情筋を柔らかくするトレーニングよ。","zh":"啊……！我那霸，真在做的是\n让面部肌肉放松的训练哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1434.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"a83690cbaaecf44b1b0d682f96b856cad4c5d14497b15800a1b475de5645cd0b","ja":"最近、取り入れてみたの。真とトレーニングメニューを\n交換することになったから、教えてあげて。","zh":"最近刚刚引入的。因为我和真交换了\n训练菜单，所以就教给她啦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1434.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"a405003262464cd2f39b655c493cfe409ba7d1e52376d8d6427e0eab9c4d8611","ja":"ええっ、何それ！？\nふたりでそんな面白そうなことをしてたの！？","zh":"诶，什么啊！？\n你们两个人竟然在做这么有趣的事吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1434.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"ef196d4779e09f9ae406fd6a2d1e48a7499a1002c43087aea04f42e00cad874b","ja":"……でも、トレーニングメニューの交換って、\nそんなに効果があるの？","zh":"……不过，交换训练项目，\n真的有那么大的效果吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1434.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"fdc2c7a5e5cede7d52e603775cf5f30d2f3e055b0fdf2c77dda399b7f576929a","ja":"うん！　今まで意識してなかった筋肉が\n鍛えられてるって、すごく実感できてるよ！","zh":"嗯！能真真切切地感受到，\n平时没怎么注意到的肌肉得到了锻炼呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1434.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"a932043dd64b8a67b942e634e91cbc295b187d95ead954b416a8b5ed7dda2fbb","ja":"この調子で続けていけば、千早に勝てるくらい\n歌がうまくなっちゃうかも！　なーんて、へへっ♪","zh":"按这个势头继续下去的话，说不定歌艺\n能提高到可以赢过千早呢！开玩笑的啦，嘿嘿♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1434.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"1235ce94f111bb6b7838b88970b11e589b1085e40cba92a14d7f682d23355385","ja":"私も真のメニューのおかげで、\n踊りながらの歌声が前より安定してる気がするわ。","zh":"我也多亏了真的训练方案，\n感觉边跳边唱时的歌声比以前更稳定了呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1434.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"0c14d9044cf40a01ca191fb23949de134fea7befe964124c7859b0fa1b849243","ja":"え～！　ふたりだけで秘密の特訓なんて\nずるいぞ！　自分も参加したい！","zh":"诶～！两个人偷偷搞特训，\n太狡猾了！我也要参加！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1434.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"cb5a976957e37e3119431018d96100ff9692775729456e2df87ca03a9db5b8d3","ja":"やっぱりそうなるよね……。じゃあ、せっかくだし\nあずささんも誘って、みんなで筋トレしよっか！","zh":"果然会变成这样呢……那既然难得有机会，\n也把梓小姐叫上，大家一起来做肌肉锻炼吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
